    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="76.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 76.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit þonne kyninges godsunu sie, bete be his were þam cyninge swa ilce swa þære mægþe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, it is the king’s godson, let him pay his wer to the king as well as to the kin.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, it is the godson of a king [who is slain], a compensation equivalent to the wergeld shall be paid to the king, as well as [the wergeld itself] to the kindred.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit þonne cyninges godsunu, bete be his were þam cyninge swa same swa þære mægþe.</ab>
      </div>
